error: installing k3s: exit 1: install failed
$ mooctl cluster node-add --name db root@h4
error: the cluster has a node db already; choose another name with --name
$ mooctl cluster node-remove node1
Removing node1 from prod
error: node1 is the control plane, which goes last; remove db, node2 first
$ mooctl cluster node-remove node2
Removing node2 from prod
Draining node2...
