$ mooctl cluster node-remove stray
Removing stray from prod
Draining stray...
Warning: if k3s still runs on stray's host, it registers again: run k3s-agent-uninstall.sh there.
Removed stray from prod
$ mooctl cluster node-remove db
Removing db from prod
error: db: connecting to root@h3: no route to host
Pass --unreachable to remove it from the cluster anyway, leaving k3s on it.
$ mooctl cluster node-remove --unreachable db
Removing db from prod
Warning: db can't be reached; if k3s still runs there, it registers again: run k3s-agent-uninstall.sh on it.
Removed db from prod
$ mooctl cluster node-remove absent
error: the cluster has no node absent
$ mooctl cluster node-remove node1
error: node1 is the cluster's last node: removing it removes the cluster's k3s and everything running on it; pass --yes to remove it
$ mooctl cluster node-remove --yes node1
Removing node1 from prod
Uninstalling...
Removed node1 from prod
